<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
  <meta content='text/html; charset=UTF-8' http-equiv='Content-Type' />
  <style>
    body { font-family: Arial, sans-serif; line-height: 1.6; color: #333; }
    .container { max-width: 600px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 20px; }
    .header { background-color: #4F46E5; color: white; padding: 20px; text-align: center; }
    .content { padding: 20px; background-color: #f9fafb; }
    .button { display: inline-block; padding: 12px 24px; background-color: #4F46E5; color: white; text-decoration: none; border-radius: 6px; margin: 20px 0; }
    .warning { background-color: #FEF3C7; border-left: 4px solid #F59E0B; padding: 12px; margin: 20px 0; }
    .footer { padding: 20px; text-align: center; font-size: 12px; color: #6b7280; }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="container">
    <div class="header">
      <h1>DevCatalyst</h1>
    </div>
    
    <div class="content">
      <h2>Please renew your consent</h2>
      
      <p>Hi <%= @user.name %>,</p>
      
      <div class="warning">
        <strong>⚠️ Action Required</strong><br>
        Your consent for <strong><%= @consent_type %></strong> has expired.
      </div>
      
      <p>You gave your consent on <%= @consented_at.strftime('%B %d, %Y') %>, which was more than 2 years ago.</p>
      
      <p>To continue using DevCatalyst, we need you to review and renew your consent. This helps us ensure that we're processing your data in accordance with your current preferences and GDPR requirements.</p>
      
      <p><strong>What happens if I don't renew?</strong></p>
      <ul>
        <li>Some features may be limited or unavailable</li>
        <li>We may need to restrict access to certain services</li>
        <li>Your account may be subject to our data retention policy</li>
      </ul>
      
      <p style="text-align: center;">
        <a href="<%= @renewal_url %>" class="button">Review and Renew Consent</a>
      </p>
      
      <p>If you have any questions about our privacy practices, please visit our Privacy Policy or contact our support team.</p>
      
      <p>Best regards,<br>The DevCatalyst Team</p>
    </div>
    
    <div class="footer">
      <p>This is an automated message. Please do not reply to this email.</p>
      <p>&copy; <%= Time.current.year %> DevCatalyst. All rights reserved.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</body>
</html>
